<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong says not eyeing Hopewell stake.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong says not eyeing Hopewell stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd said on Thursday it had no plan to buy shares in Hopewell Holdings Ltd but cooperation between the two groups was possible.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no plan to buy Hopewell shares, but cooperation projects are possible,&quot; Cheung Kong chairman Li Ka-shing told reporters after the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>There have been rumours that Cheung Kong unit Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd might take a stake in Hopewell or its projects.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
